{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the new crusader amongst the order of the almighty and must uphold the Almighty's teachings and serve out justice in his name! Will you be a paragon of justice, a punisher of the wicked, or will you use the power you wield to strike fear in the eyes of all? Looks like its gonna be quite the adventure for... Crusaderman!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traditional side-view turn-based battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyword based branching dialogue system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can challenge almost everyone to fights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixel Art made by myself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack developed by myself.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592450?t=1744690732","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592450?t=1744690732","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592450/25cf37d75abe56bcd88e206a73022a5c0a8cdd0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744690732","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592450/25cf37d75abe56bcd88e206a73022a5c0a8cdd0a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744690732","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the new crusader amongst the order of the almighty and must uphold the Almighty's teachings and serve out justice in his name! Will you be a paragon of justice, a punisher of the wicked, or will you use the power you wield to strike fear in the eyes of all? Looks like its gonna be quite the adventure for... Crusaderman!</p><p class